@startuml
title Sequence Diagram 03 - Temporary Seat Locking with Redis

actor "Customer" as Customer
participant "Web / Mobile Client" as Client
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Reservation Service" as Reservation
database "Redis" as Redis
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Customer -> Client: Select seat
Client -> Gateway: POST /reservations/lock-seat
Gateway -> Reservation: Lock selected seat

Reservation -> Redis: SET seat_lock:eventId:seatId userId EX 600 NX

alt Lock is successful
    Redis --> Reservation: OK
    Reservation -> DB: Create reservation with PENDING status
    DB --> Reservation: Reservation saved
    Reservation --> Gateway: Seat locked successfully
    Gateway --> Client: Show checkout page
    Client --> Customer: Seat is locked for 10 minutes
else Seat is already locked
    Redis --> Reservation: Lock rejected
    Reservation --> Gateway: Seat is not available
    Gateway --> Client: Show seat unavailable message
    Client --> Customer: Select another seat
end

@enduml
